            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice STEVENS, justice Stevens noted a much higher percentage of African\u2011Americans in Grand Rapids than in the county as a whole."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice SCALIA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether a juror must be a resident of the district to serve."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice SCALIA; Mr. RESTUCCIA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Restuccia answered \"Yes\" when Justice Scalia asked whether a juror must be a resident of the district."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice KENNEDY",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether a statistically significant underrepresentation constitutes systematic exclusion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice ROBERTS",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked where the record shows Grand Rapids had a disproportionate need for jurors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. RESTUCCIA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Restuccia responded that neither side established a disproportionate need."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked what is unreasonable about the petitioner\u2019s argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens questioned how to handle a 2\u20113\u202f% disparity caused by minority excuses for non\u2011service."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy suggested that such a disparity might be a policy issue rather than constitutional."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 47,
              "start": 47
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether any courts enforce juror attendance by issuing bench warrants and arresting non\u2011showing jurors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 50,
              "start": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts again asked where the record shows the alleged need for jurors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "469fd9c940b27a348d7689f7424a54f601c3572443d24cbc7fed4e41158a92b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-469fd9c940b2-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 51,
              "start": 51
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg noted that the change in the draw from the circuit pool reduced the comparative difference from 18\u202f% to 15\u202f%, questioning whether that is a significant change."
      }
    ],
